---- MODULE StockCheck ----
EXTENDS Integers

VARIABLES inputStock, inputQuantity, expected, actual

Expected(s, q) == IF q > s THEN s ELSE s - q
Actual(stock, quantity) == <%= expression %>

Init ==
  \E s \in 0..4, q \in 0..4:
    /\ inputStock = s
    /\ inputQuantity = q
    /\ expected = Expected(s, q)
    /\ actual = Actual(s, q)

Next == UNCHANGED <<inputStock, inputQuantity, expected, actual>>
Conforms == actual = expected
====
